When it comes to mobile applications that consumers consistently use, news apps lead the pack in app retention. This makes sense because finding out what's going on in the world is one of the most common ways people use their mobile devices.
There are a lot of great news applications and news aggregators for the iPhone and now news junkies have one more app they can add to their stable of source material: ZenNews (iTunes link). ZenNews takes on the news aggregator space with a nice real-time/social media influenced twist.
From Zensify, makers of the social media app (also called Zensify) for the iPhone, ZenNews brings real-time news and updates to the iPhone with some visual flair.
News Stories Visualized
